scription><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 01:31:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/new-drone-video-shows-teslas-optimus-factory-reaching-a-turning-point</guid></item><item><title>科学家一个多世纪以来首次命名了一个新的猫科动物物种</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-name-a-new-cat-species-for-the-first-time-in-over-a-century</link><description>一项新的研究发现，南美虎猫不是一个物种，而是五个不同的物种。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-name-a-new-cat-species-for-the-first-time-in-over-a-century.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 01:16:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-name-a-new-cat-species-for-the-first-time-in-over-a-century</guid></item><item><title>研究人员观察到声音中的首次实时量子跃迁</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-observe-first-real-time-quantum-jump-in-sound</link><description>斯坦福大学的研究人员观察到单个声子或声音的量子单位在机械谐振器中产生离散的能量跳跃。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/researchers-observe-first-real-time-quantum-jump-in-sound.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 01:01:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/researchers-observe-first-real-time-quantum-jump-in-sound</guid></item><item><title>Insilico Medicine AI 药物 Rentosertib 缩短了六个独立蛋白质时钟的生物年龄</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/insilico-medicine-ai-drug-rentosertib-cuts-biological-age-on-six-independent-protein-clocks</link><description>没有说多少，除非我浏览了一下。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/insilico-medicine-ai-drug-rentosertib-cuts-biological-age-on-six-independent-protein-clocks.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:46:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/insilico-medicine-ai-drug-rentosertib-cuts-biological-age-on-six-independent-protein-clocks</guid></item><item><title>人工智能先驱吴恩达称灭绝恐惧为“科幻小说”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-pioneer-andrew-ng-calls-extinction-fears-science-fiction</link><description>人工智能先驱吴恩达表示，顶级模型制造商的研究人员对存在人工智能风险的警告是“科幻小说”，可能不利于确保该技术为社会带来最大利益。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-pioneer-andrew-ng-calls-extinction-fears-science-fiction2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:31:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-pioneer-andrew-ng-calls-extinction-fears-science-fiction</guid></item><item><title>制造人工智能系统并没有失败——而是你的数据</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/manufacturing-ai-systems-arent-failing-your-data-is</link><description>当真正的限制几乎总是在上游：它们下面的数据基础设施时，制造人工智能系统被指责为停滞不前。麻省理工学院&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/manufacturing-ai-systems-arent-failing-your-data-is.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:16:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/manufacturing-ai-systems-arent-failing-your-data-is</guid></item><item><title>在早期试验中，单一静脉注射治疗可重新训练免疫细胞对抗自身免疫性疾病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-single-iv-treatment-retrains-immune-cells-to-fight-autoimmune-diseases-in-early-trial</link><description>CAR T 细胞疗法是一种免疫重编程程序，可将患者自身的免疫细胞转变为抗癌专家。整个过程很复杂，但研究人员现在找到了一种更快的方法，使用无害的工程病毒的单次静脉（IV）滴注即可达到类似的效果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-single-iv-treatment-retrains-immune-cells-to-fight-autoimmune-diseases-in-early-trial2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:01:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-single-iv-treatment-retrains-immune-cells-to-fight-autoimmune-diseases-in-early-trial</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现细胞可以欺骗死亡并重建受损组织</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-discover-cells-that-cheat-death-and-rebuild-damaged-tissue</link><description>科学家们发现了一群细胞可以启动程序性细胞死亡过程并存活下来，然后帮助快速重建受损组织。它们的后代对未来的损害具有更强的抵抗力，揭示了一种可以改善愈合但也可能帮助癌症在治疗后复发的机制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-discover-cells-that-cheat-death-and-rebuild-damaged-tissue.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 23:46:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-discover-cells-that-cheat-death-and-rebuild-damaged-tissue</guid></item></channel></rss>